{"seq":6,"slug":"ai-music-generation","title":"AI 音乐生成","stage":"DONE","category":"music-audio","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation","rating":{"composite":3.79,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# AI 音乐生成\n\nAI 音乐生成是人工智能与音乐创作的交叉领域，利用深度学习模型自动或辅助生成音乐内容。从早期基于规则的算法作曲到当代基于 Transformer 和扩散模型的端到端生成，这一领域经历了从\"模式匹配\"到\"创意理解\"的范式跃迁。\n\n本 Hub 系统覆盖 AI 音乐生成的四个核心维度：音乐表示方法（如何将音乐编码为模型可处理的数据）、生成模型架构（Transformer、扩散模型、VAE 等核心算法）、可控生成技术（如何让生成结果满足特定音乐需求）、以及评估与伦理问题（如何衡量生成质量、如何处理版权和创作归属）。\n\nAI 音乐生成不是要取代人类音乐家，而是为创作提供新的工具和可能性——从灵感激发到素材生成，从编曲辅助到个性化音乐推荐。理解其技术原理有助于音乐人更有效地利用这些工具，同时保持对创作本质的清醒认知。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"music-representation","title":"音乐表示方法","docCount":3,"url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/music-representation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"symbolic-midi","title":"MIDI 与符号音乐表示","url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/music-representation/symbolic-midi"},{"seq":2,"slug":"audio-spectrogram","title":"音频频谱表示","url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/music-representation/audio-spectrogram"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tokenization","title":"音乐 Token 化策略","url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/music-representation/tokenization"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"generative-models","title":"生成模型架构","docCount":3,"url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/generative-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"transformer-music","title":"Transformer 音乐生成","url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/generative-models/transformer-music"},{"seq":2,"slug":"diffusion-audio","title":"扩散模型音频生成","url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/generative-models/diffusion-audio"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vae-latent","title":"VAE 与潜空间音乐模型","url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/generative-models/vae-latent"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"controllable-generation","title":"可控生成技术","docCount":3,"url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/controllable-generation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"conditional-generation","title":"条件音乐生成","url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/controllable-generation/conditional-generation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"style-transfer","title":"风格迁移与融合","url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/controllable-generation/style-transfer"},{"seq":3,"slug":"human-ai-collab","title":"人机协作音乐创作","url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/controllable-generation/human-ai-collab"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"evaluation-ethics","title":"评估与伦理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/evaluation-ethics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"evaluation-metrics","title":"音乐生成评估方法","url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/evaluation-ethics/evaluation-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"copyright-issues","title":"AI 音乐版权问题","url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/evaluation-ethics/copyright-issues"},{"seq":3,"slug":"creation-ethics","title":"AI 音乐创作伦理","url":"/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/evaluation-ethics/creation-ethics"}]}]}